@FleetDesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5181

### Login
# @name login
POST {{FleetDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Listar vehiculos (requiere el token devuelto por el login)
GET {{FleetDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Vehiculos con mantenimiento vencido
GET {{FleetDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/overdue-vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
